{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f0884a5496b3ee2348e2a6edeacfa5a6879de8f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}+\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}}{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+1}}-\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}},\\]\" width=\"321\" height=\"50\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f79a9f533c04d98159feac9b33d240531642a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2\\sqrt{2}-1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"536\" height=\"43\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e82e7d44bbf565d1488583e41062a8fab59e5a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}+\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}}{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"209\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b094f750a5ab0216231af757031bf7876f5e522c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"123\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/405ce4d1c0efa327ba688cfda76b38a553bbe599.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^2&amp;=\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}+\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}\\right)^2}{\\left(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+1}\\right)^2} \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{5}+2\\right)+2\\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}\\right)+\\left(\\sqrt{5}-2\\right)}{\\sqrt{5}+1} \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{5}+2\\right)+2+\\left(\\sqrt{5}-2\\right)}{\\sqrt{5}+1} \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}+2}{\\sqrt{5}+1} \\\\ &amp;=2. \\end{align*}\" width=\"445\" height=\"274\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/2/462aac924ab22435d2e3baf16c66ef01ab8c2e23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56bdf258711d800aea22765860c7e22e4d416a43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>On the other hand, note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/829413f726b747c4009b2a533cc0f9bffe75e5a2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} y^2&amp;=3-2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ &amp;=2-2\\sqrt{2}+1 \\\\ &amp;=\\left(\\sqrt{2}-1\\right)^2. \\end{align*}\" width=\"135\" height=\"94\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a9e95d10307782ab933b186fd90be634d75dd1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a622c8e86cbe26d6839e4d68b7c70fdc04a17492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt{2}-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Finally, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/63366bd94c02d6e4bf51d8ac64bd0f15332c38ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=x-y=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1}.\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Someonenumber011 (Fundamental Logic)\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM (Reconstruction)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e82e7d44bbf565d1488583e41062a8fab59e5a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}+\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}}{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"209\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b094f750a5ab0216231af757031bf7876f5e522c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt{3-2\\sqrt{2}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"123\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d8ff4f73a033849cef445123a88dc57001a661.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+2}+\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-2}}{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}+1}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-1}}{\\sqrt{\\sqrt{5}-1}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3+\\sqrt{5}}+\\sqrt{7-3\\sqrt{5}}}{2}. \\hspace{15mm} (\\bigstar)\\]\" width=\"601\" height=\"50\" />\nWe rewrite each term in the numerator separately:\n</p>\n<ol style=\"margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n  <li>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/97353c63f9ffe10bb1c8ce114372882c616cd2d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{3+\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"169\" height=\"35\" /> for some nonnegative rational numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/6583a799ce46b06b1cceb493abb45a07c88fd6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" /> We square both sides of this equation, then rearrange:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/0/58003a473b05f805999d6e6f3e6c10c7a2bb36c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a+b+2\\sqrt{ab}&amp;=3+\\sqrt{5} \\\\ a+b+\\sqrt{4ab}&amp;=3+\\sqrt{5}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"186\" height=\"49\" />\nIt follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a87f10766ff7eadbc14b2a6734d4f9f2d7023e4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a+b&amp;=3, \\\\ ab&amp;=\\frac54. \\end{align*}\" width=\"80\" height=\"61\" />\nBy inspection, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d779ddd9ec64ab4d6ebc6b0810b899ee24bdb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a,b\\}=\\left\\{\\frac12,\\frac52\\right\\}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"139\" height=\"45\" /> Alternatively, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are the solutions to the quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73cc77d80e9863c83bef6ef1b5df1cd7b96e0812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^2-3t+\\frac54=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"38\" /> by Vieta's Formulas, in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba515af8e32b12bb727c6fa047aa3997043864ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\frac12,\\frac52.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" /> <p> Therefore, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/ceec8b0def0605f4ac4234786bdc25b9c1128f36.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{3+\\sqrt{5}}=\\sqrt{\\frac12}+\\sqrt{\\frac52}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}.\\]\" width=\"295\" height=\"43\" /></p></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n  </p><li>Similarly, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/287a2623f3c3b52a1e471d3120945427b8294faf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{7-3\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}.\\]\" width=\"205\" height=\"41\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></ol>\n<p>Substituting these results into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458f4c22e3fa988062d6b0856b2d421bf939f7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\bigstar),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7451af2648654ed70f528f1e4291e5b3b76235.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{3\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}\\right)}{2}=\\sqrt2.\\]\" width=\"305\" height=\"52\" />\nOn the other hand, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29de6bb314680d47f6334601c17134c6ab48cad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=\\sqrt2-1\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" /> by the argument of either Solution 1 or Solution 2.\n</p><p>Finally, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/63366bd94c02d6e4bf51d8ac64bd0f15332c38ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=x-y=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1}.\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" t